[1mFeature combinations:[22m [38;5;10mtranslation/Cargo.toml[0m has no [38;5;10m[features][0m table, so there is exactly one valid configuration (default = [38;5;10m--no-default-features[0m). [38;5;10mrun_parity.sh[0m derives this programmatically from the [38;5;10m[features][0m table (power set) rather than hardcoding it, so it stays correct if features are added later. [38;5;10mcargo check --no-default-features --all-targets[0m is clean.[0m[0m
